OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's in store now the Big Burns
OL,4,ASupper is no more?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a three-day "winter
OL,7,Fextravaganza" in Dumfries have been
OL,8,Funveiled following the demise of the
OL,9,FBig Burns Supper (BBS) festival.
OL,11,FOrganisers admitted the old format -
OL,12,Fwhich brought big name artists to the
OL,13,Ftown for more than a decade - was
OL,14,F"never really sustainable".
OL,16,FIn its place is an entirely free
OL,17,FDumfries and Galloway Carnival
OL,18,Fprogramme from 29 to 31 January with
OL,19,Flight installations, music and hundreds
OL,20,Fof community performers.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
