OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's in store now the Big Burns
OL,4,ASupper is no more?
OL,5,
OL,6,FExecutive producer Graham Main said
OL,7,Fthey were aware money was tight for
OL,8,Fmany people and he hoped the new format
OL,9,Fwas right for the town and the region
OL,10,Fas a whole.
